      "name": "mcp_search",
      "description": "Search the MCP server store for an installable server when a capability needed for the user's task is missing from the available tools, or when the user asks about server integrations. Returns matching servers (slug, name, description). Keep discovery relevant to the authorized task and avoid unrelated recommendations. If an exact result would materially help, explain why and use request_mcp_install; the user confirms installation, and search itself changes nothing.",
